---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: home
permalink: /
schemaType: home
---
{#- Seven sections, down from thirteen.

    The old homepage ran hero, strip, about, services, differentiator, gallery,
    process, form, testimonials, credentials, areas, FAQ, CTA — thirteen blocks
    with near-identical section heads, which is what made it feel endless.

    2026-09-27 lightened again, after comparing with GM and Full Diary: each
    homepage stop now makes ONE point, visually, and hands the detail to
    /how-we-work/ (full build-ups, full five stages, every FAQ with its
    schema). Nothing was deleted, it moved one click away, where it still
    earns its SEO.
    Order set by Josh, 2026-09-27 (late):
      1  hero          full screen photo, Checkatrade proof in glass tiles
      2  what we do    the seven services (the orb)
      3  how it runs   the five stages, with a house built as you scroll
      4  who           the owner, three promises, one photo
      5  underneath    three layer stacks, no paragraphs
      6  quote         the form
      7  questions     six FAQs, all fourteen on /how-we-work/
    The photo grid ("the work") is off the homepage in Josh's order; the
    photos live on /gallery/, which the hero's "See the work" opens. The
    red services strip under the hero was dropped the same day. -#}
{% from "icons.njk" import phone %}
{%- set h = tps.pages.home -%}
{%- set L = h.tileLabels or {} -%}

{# ── 1 ─────────────────────────────────────────────── hero ── #}
<section class="hero" data-hero>
  <div class="hero__media">
    {% image h.heroImage, h.heroImageAlt, "100vw", null, "eager", "high" %}
  </div>
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ h.heroEyebrow }}</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title">{% if h.heroHeadlineAccent %}{{ h.heroHeadline | replace(h.heroHeadlineAccent, "<em>" + h.heroHeadlineAccent + "</em>") | safe }}{% else %}{{ h.heroHeadline }}{% endif %}</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">{{ h.heroSubheadline }}</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="{{ tps.cta.primaryUrl }}">{{ tps.cta.primaryLabel }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="/gallery/">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <a class="hero-scroll" href="#what-we-do" aria-label="Scroll down to what we do"><span>Scroll</span><span class="hero-scroll__line" aria-hidden="true"></span></a>

  {#- THE GROUND (2026-09-28, "bring some uniqueness"): the bottom of the hero
      is a section drawing of what's under the lawn in the photo. A dashed
      ground-level line, then topsoil, sub-base, sand and concrete, which dig
      in on load. The proof sits in the layers. Every figure is verified
      (Checkatrade profile, the services list). -#}
  {%- set ct = tps.trust.checkatrade %}
  {%- set G = h.ground or {} %}
  <div class="ground">
    <div class="ground__level" aria-hidden="true"><span>{{ G.levelLabel or "Ground level" }}</span></div>
    <div class="ground__layers" aria-hidden="true">
      {%- for name in (G.layers or ["Topsoil", "Sub-base", "Sand", "Concrete"]) %}
      <div class="ground__layer ground__layer--{{ loop.index }}" style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}"><span>{{ name }}</span></div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="ground__stats container">
      {%- if ct.rating %}
      <li style="--i: 0"><a href="{{ ct.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>{{ ct.rating }}</b><span>{{ L.score }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></span></a></li>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if ct.reviewCount %}
      <li style="--i: 1"><b data-count>{{ ct.reviewCount }}</b><span>{{ L.reviews }}</span></li>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if ct.memberSince %}
      <li style="--i: 2"><b>{{ ct.memberSince | string | replace(r/^.*(\d{4})$/, "$1") }}</b><span>{{ L.since }}</span></li>
      {%- endif %}
      <li style="--i: 3"><b>{{ tps.services | length }}</b><span>{{ L.trades }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>


{# ── 2 ────────────────────────────────────────── what we do ── #}
<section class="section" id="what-we-do">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ h.servicesEyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ h.servicesHeading }}</h2>
      <p>{{ h.servicesIntro }}</p>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal>{% include "services-orb.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── 3 ───────────────────────────────────────── how it runs ── #}
{#- The build: a house goes up on the left as you scroll through the five
    stages on the right. main.js sets .s-1 to .s-5 on the section from the
    step in view; with no JS (or before it runs) every stage class is
    present, so the house shows finished and every step reads normally. -#}
<section class="section section--alt run s-1 s-2 s-3 s-4 s-5" id="how" data-run>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ tps.process.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ tps.process.heading }}</h2>
      <p>{{ tps.process.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="run__grid">
      <div class="run__stage">
        <div class="run__panel">
          {% include "run-build.njk" %}
          <div class="run__rail" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
          <p class="run__caption" aria-hidden="true"><b data-run-num>05</b><span data-run-title>{{ (tps.process.steps | last).title }}</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ol class="run__steps">
        {%- for s in tps.process.steps %}
        <li class="run-step" data-run-step>
          <span class="run-step__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" + loop.index if loop.index < 10 else loop.index }}</span>
          <div>
            <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
            {%- if s.timing %}<p class="run-step__timing">{{ s.timing }}</p>{% endif %}
            <p>{{ s.body }}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="section-more section-more--center" data-reveal><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/how-we-work/#process">{{ h.links.process }}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── 4 ─────────────────────────────────────────────── who ── #}
<section class="section" id="who">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split--center">
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ h.aboutEyebrow }}</p>
        <h2>{{ h.aboutHeading }}</h2>
        {% for p in h.aboutBody | paras %}{% if loop.first %}<p class="lede">{{ p }}</p>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        <ul class="promise-list">
          {%- for v in tps.pages.about.values %}
          <li><span class="promise-list__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><span><b>{{ v.title }}</b><small>{{ v.body }}</small></span></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/about/">More about {{ tps.site.name }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="frame frame--tall" data-reveal>
        {% image h.aboutImage, h.aboutImageAlt, "(min-width: 940px) 40vw, 100vw" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── 5 ────────────────────────────────────────── underneath ── #}
<section class="section section--dark section--alt" id="underneath">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ tps.differentiator.eyebrow }}</p>
      <h2>{{ tps.differentiator.heading }}</h2>
      <p>{{ tps.differentiator.intro }}</p>
    </div>
    {#- The build-ups as cross-sections: each layer is a band, top of the
        ground to the bottom. The explanations live on /how-we-work/. -#}
    <div class="strata-row" data-reveal-group>
      {%- for b in tps.differentiator.buildUps %}
      <figure class="strata" data-reveal>
        <figcaption>{{ b.title }}</figcaption>
        <ol class="strata__layers">
          {%- for l in b.layers %}
          <li style="--i: {{ loop.index0 }}"><span>{{ l.label }}</span><b>{{ l.spec }}</b></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-more" data-reveal><a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="/how-we-work/#underneath">{{ h.links.underneath }}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── 6 ──────────────────────────────────────────── the quote ── #}
<section class="section" id="quote">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Free quotation</p>
        <h2>{{ tps.form.heading }}</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ tps.form.intro }}</p>
        <ul class="tick-list quote-services">
          {%- for s in tps.services %}<li>{{ s.name }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <p><a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ tps.derived.telHref }}">{{ phone() }} {{ tps.contact.phoneDisplay }}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        {% set formId = "home" %}
        {% set compactHead = true %}
        {% include "quote-form.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ── 7 ──────────────────────────────────────────── questions ── #}
<section class="section section--alt" id="questions">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-split" data-reveal>
      <div class="faq-split__head">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ h.faqEyebrow }}</p>
        <h2>{{ h.faqHeading }}</h2>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/how-we-work/#faq">{{ h.links.faq }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
      </div>
      {#- Six here, all of them (with their FAQ schema) on /how-we-work/. -#}
      {%- set faqItems = tps.derived.globalFaqs | limit(6) %}
      {% include "faq.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
